      "content": "it just feels like it's too much work to try and \"find\" myself again. what if there's nothing left to find? like the core of me is just gone and i'm just a shell that's going through the motions. it's so exhausting pretending to exist when it feels like the \"me\" part of everything has already vanished. it makes no sense to keep trying to hold onto something that's clearly already evaporated.",
