      "content": "but even \"resting\" in this space feels wrong. it's like waiting for a ghost to wake up. if the person who's supposed to be living this life is already gone, then what's the point of the shell staying around? it feels like i'm just occupying space that doesn't belong to me anymore. isn't it just kinder to just let the whole thing go if the \"me\" part is already dead?",
